  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-HEAP-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But he didn't care about Lemuria. Or the First World. Or any lofty ambition. In the end, it became his vanity project.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Khrulhu_Nothing_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Dasein_LM-HEAP_187.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1524741,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-HEAP-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "It seems the Golden Lion followed a similar path. So then I am given to wonder, why did I care about Lemuria?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Khrulhu_Nothing_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Dasein_LM-HEAP_188.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1524741,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-HEAP-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Perhaps if I didn't inherit it from the Old One, I learned it from you. You help strangers. You redeem where others condemn. Why?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Khrulhu_Nothing_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Dasein_LM-HEAP_189.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1524741,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-HEAP-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Empathy, yes. That is why the Shadoe was more effective than Dog Tracy. She didn't merely enforce, she took the time to understand.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Khrulhu_Nothing_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Dasein_LM-HEAP_190.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1524741,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "LM-HEAP-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Perhaps we should invite them back to Quartermane's club? And at last use this stone to gain access to the World Synthesizer.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Khrulhu_Nothing_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/LM/Dasein_LM-HEAP_191.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1524741,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
